.godot/
artifacts/
bin/
obj/
*.user
.kards-ui-workspace

# Exported game builds (tools/release.ps1 writes here; players get these, git does not).
dist/

# Test diagnostics (hang dumps can be hundreds of MB).
tests/TestResults/

# Agent workbench memory — local notes, not project source.
.workbuddy/
.workbuddy-ai/
.claude/

# Android 构建模板由 Godot 的 "Install Android Build Template" 生成（约 200 MB），不入库
/android/
/dist/android/

# 本地生成的「更新档案」静态网页：资料快照，不是游戏源码，也不随仓库更新。
